# Temporary directories
# Anchored: this is the git-worktree convention at the REPO ROOT
# (tree/feat/<name>). Unanchored, it matches any directory named tree/
# anywhere — which silently swallowed web source for two days.
/tree/
# Some developers also carry an unanchored `tree/` in their GLOBAL gitignore,
# which this repo's rules override. A file cannot be re-included once its
# parent directory is excluded, so the directory itself is un-ignored here.
!crates/crucible-web/web/src/components/tree/
.worktrees/
.cargo/*
!.cargo/config.toml
WORKTREE.md

# Session artifacts (from session architecture tests)
**/Sessions/

